OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker showcases
OL,12,     Fperformances from this year's
OL,13,     Fsummer music festivals, including
OL,14,     FBerlioz from the BBC Proms, Bach
OL,15,     Ffrom Verbier and early music from
OL,16,     FGranada.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Montgeroult
OL,18,     F2/5. Donald Macleod hears how
OL,19,     FFrance's Reign of Terror turned
OL,20,     FMontgeroult's life upside-down.
